BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Lectures and Training] Cancer Prevention and Control (CPC) & Disc
 overy and Developmental Therapeutics (DDT) Research Programs Joint Gyn/Onc
  Symposium — Bridging Discovery and Prevention: A Collaborative Approach
  to Gynecologic Cancer Research at Winship
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T140000
DTSTAMP:20260920T141720Z
UID:winship-331fa87598c5816bef5918a0@emory-seminars
DESCRIPTION:Program: Lectures and Training\n\nSpeaker: Cancer Prevention a
 nd Control (CPC) & Discovery and Developmental Therapeutics (DDT) Research
  Programs Joint Gyn/Onc Symposium\n\nEvent type: Lectures and Training\n\n
 Talk title: Bridging Discovery and Prevention: A Collaborative Approach to
  Gynecologic Cancer Research at Winship\n\nJoin us for "Bridging Discovery
  and Prevention: A Collaborative Approach to Gynecologic Cancer Research a
 t Winship." We invite you to take part in a day of collaboration\, insight
 \, and forward-thinking discussion as we bring together researchers and cl
 inicians from across disciplines to explore innovative approaches to gynec
 ologic cancer research and identify opportunities to advance prevention\, 
 discovery\, treatment\, and survivorship through meaningful partnerships. 
 Program Highlights Research updates in ovarian\, uterine\, and cervical/HP
 V cancers Prevention\, survivorship\, and population health perspectives C
 ross-disciplinary presentations from basic\, translational\, and clinical 
 researchers Interactive discussions and collaborative brainstorming sessio
 ns Networking with colleagues across Winship and partner institutions Sche
 dule Date: Monday\, October 5\, 2026 8:00 a.m. | Check-In\, Breakfast & Ne
 tworking 8:15 a.m. | Welcome and Opening Remarks 8:30 a.m. – 11:40 a.m. 
 | Scientific Talks and Interactive Discussions 11:40 a.m. – 12:20 p.m. |
  Collaboration and Brainstorming Session 12:20 p.m. | Closing Remarks 12:2
 5 p.m. – 1:30 p.m. | Lunch and Networking\n\nSource: https://apps.winshi
 pcancer.emory.edu/admin/Event/6774/cancer-prevention-and-control-cpc--disc
 overy-and-developmental-therapeutics-ddt-research-programs-joint-gynonc-sy
 mposium---bridging-discovery-and-prevention-a-collaborative-approach-to-gy
 necologic-cancer-research-at-winship/
LOCATION:John H. Kauffman Auditorium (C5012\, 5th Floor Winship) Winship C
 ancer Institute 1365 Clifton Road NE\, Building C Atlanta \, Georgia 30322
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://apps.winshipcancer.emory.edu/admin/Event/6774/cancer-preventio
 n-and-control-cpc--discovery-and-developmental-therapeutics-ddt-research-p
 rograms-joint-gynonc-symposium---bridging-discovery-and-prevention-a-colla
 borative-approach-to-gynecologic-cancer-research-at-winship/
